# Build output. Large, and reproducible from the sources beside it.
target/

# Findings are deliberately NOT ignored. An artifact is a finding until someone
# shows it is not, and one that only ever existed on the machine that found it
# is one nobody else can reproduce. The nightly workflow uploads them and fails
# the job; if one is ever committed, that is a bug report in the repository,
# which is where it belongs.
#
# The corpus is not ignored either, for the reason the nightly fuzz workflow gives: it is the
# accumulated set of inputs that reached distinct branches, and a fuzzer that
# starts from nothing each night never gets past the shallow ones.
